# CapitalSense Paper Desk — Upstox API Credentials
#
# 1. Open an Upstox demat account (free) at https://upstox.com
# 2. Go to https://upstox.com/developer/api-documentation/
# 3. Create an App in the Developer Portal
# 4. Navigate to the Analytics tab → Generate Token → Confirm
# 5. Copy the 1-year read-only Analytics Token below
#
# This token is valid for 1 year and supports market data & WebSocket feeds.
# It does NOT support placing real orders (read-only).

UPSTOX_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_analytics_token_here
